Closes: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/drm/i915/kernel/-/work_items/16359
Reviewed-by: Menachem Adin <menachem.adin@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Alexander Usyskin <alexander.usyskin@intel.com>
